  "description": "Yeona and her three longtime friends have shared an unshakable bond for years, one so familiar it feels safe from romance. Believing none of them see her as a woman, she lets her guard down and falls asleep at Taehyeok’s place. But in the stillness of the night, a lingering touch awakens desires that have been carefully hidden, and a single moment of weakness begins to unravel their friendship into something far more dangerous and irresistibly tempting.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
